Third-party material
--------------------

Sources/ShellMetal/Colormaps.swift builds its colour lookup tables from anchor colours taken from:

- matplotlib's "viridis" and "inferno" colormaps (Nathaniel J. Smith, Stefan van der Walt, Eric Firing), released under
  CC0 1.0 Universal (https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/). No attribution is required; it is given here
  as a courtesy.

- ColorBrewer's "RdBu" diverging scheme (Copyright 2002 Cynthia Brewer, Mark Harrower and The Pennsylvania State
  University), licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0). The scheme
  is used here as a handful of anchor colours that are interpolated. ColorBrewer is a product of Cynthia Brewer
  (colorbrewer2.org).
